  <FactionDef ParentName="HelghastFactionBase">
    <defName>HelghastJuntaFaction</defName>
    <label>Helghan Junta</label>
    <description>Perhaps the most common form of Helghan successor state, this group of Helghast militants have banded around one or more charismatic military or political figures. These rump states exist to further the ambitions of their leadership, assaulting rimworlds, bringing years of experience to bear on local populations. Aside from a few extreme examples, most of these regimes are willing to interact or treat with other xenotypes under certain circumstances, especially as tributaries, satrapies, or protectorates. Even though any one of these militant factions is a far cry from the former majesty of the Helghan armed forces, each of these miniature empires has a real shot at becoming a legitimate successor state to the Helghan regime. Many would be autarchs have risen from these. At their most restrained, regimes like these seek to demilitarize and rule over other factions on their given world to establish safe territory for Helghast refugee settlement and the establishment of megacorps. At their worst, they are genocidal warmongers hell-bent on blood and death.</description>
    <factionIconPath>UI/Icons/HelgFaction_Fist</factionIconPath>
  </FactionDef>

